{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07509","headline":"送姨子弟往南郊 · 刘长卿","name":"送姨子弟往南郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一展慰久阔，寸心仍未伸。\n别时两童稚，及此俱成人。\n那堪适会面，遽已悲分首。\n客路向楚云，河桥对衰柳。\n送君匹马别河桥，汝南山郭寒萧条。\n今我单车复西上，郎去灞陵转惆怅。\n何处共伤离别心，明月亭亭两乡望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}